            },
            "reviewBody": "Just like I remember from church potluck. I don't use much whipped topping and I could only find it in 8 oz size so that's all I used and it worked out perfectly. I also added about 1/2 cup of chopped pecans. Delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2008-06-28T21:11:02.893Z"
